-- Relative-clause commute witness (ex43): juxtaposition is &, so the mask is the same whichever side of & the clause sits on. Twin of 43-relative-clause.bqn (the clause∧nord ≡ nord∧clause assertion): same fixture, flipped conjuncts, same post-state.
-- Comparison binds tighter than &, so the line parses (TwoHanded > 60) & Nord.
--! registry ../registries/43-relative-clause-a.reg
